                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a00001aa-dc9b-3be8-9af6-7eaf7a1ee3eb",
                        "entry_id": "9983c370-1fa5-3d39-92ef-ee02f70759f0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "veel eerbied en angst hebben voor God en zijn geboden"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5f72095c-83ac-4b44-946b-ae13b6cd16f5",
                                "sense_id": "a00001aa-dc9b-3be8-9af6-7eaf7a1ee3eb",
                                "text": "Enkele honderden parochianen demonstreerden zaterdagochtend in de anders zo godvrezende gemeente, om de pastoor duidelijk te maken dat hij beter kan vertrekken. Dat deden ze in stilte, omdat zij een nette, beschaafde demonstratie wilden houden, zo meldt Omroep Brabant. Toch liet een van de aanwezigen zich ontvallen in staat te zijn ’al zijn botten te breken.’"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e6d914b3-9cf6-4e62-9efe-6eaa2e318c46",
                                "sense_id": "a00001aa-dc9b-3be8-9af6-7eaf7a1ee3eb",
                                "text": "Jammeh zei aanvankelijk de uitslag te respecteren maar veranderde vrijdag van mening. Hij verklaarde nieuwe verkiezingen te willen uitschrijven. „Na grondig onderzoek heb ik besloten de verkiezingsuitslag te verwerpen.” Volgens Jammeh vonden er tijdens het stemmen ernstige onrechtmatigheden plaats. „Ik beveel nieuwe en transparante verkiezingen aan die worden voorgezeten door een godvrezende en onafhankelijke kiescommissie.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ab811931-ee36-3195-9f61-fec575dd4585",
                        "entry_id": "9983c370-1fa5-3d39-92ef-ee02f70759f0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "braaf, netjes en bescheiden"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "84945188-c3da-4db5-a272-8a2ee12e138d",
                                "sense_id": "ab811931-ee36-3195-9f61-fec575dd4585",
                                "text": "Wees een goed en godvrezend kind."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d7a7a9d4-723c-4ee9-b3c8-bb16ec7f0fec",
                        "source_entry_id": "9983c370-1fa5-3d39-92ef-ee02f70759f0",
                        "source_sense_id": "a00001aa-dc9b-3be8-9af6-7eaf7a1ee3eb",
                        "target_lang_word": "pious",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pious",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eabc9db7-2c84-3997-a8e0-b50e3a8be39f",
                                        "entry_id": "e0aed5d2-b1f3-3f56-86e1-8a1b50203d86",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or pertaining to piety, exhibiting piety, devout, god-fearing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94fae5c2-ec45-4edb-87b8-70df418e3af3",
                                                "sense_id": "eabc9db7-2c84-3997-a8e0-b50e3a8be39f",
                                                "text": "Old Deacon Smith was quick to see the impression made by Abby Howard upon the mind of his son, and he was wonderfully pleased thereat, for Abby was the oldest daughter of the good Deacon Howard, and was herself a church member, and pious. He had more hope for his son now, than he had felt for years."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "49f47377-7055-4b90-a5bd-ada7e633f38c",
                                                "sense_id": "eabc9db7-2c84-3997-a8e0-b50e3a8be39f",
                                                "text": "Its male residents dress like crows: heavy black suits, black Borsalino hats, the old grandfathers hugely whiskered and the boys in peot, the curled sidelocks of the pious."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1eeca9a4-7923-3cec-91fa-ef634e197d2c",
                                        "entry_id": "e0aed5d2-b1f3-3f56-86e1-8a1b50203d86",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relating to religion or religious works."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae9b5ae3-8696-4d00-af1e-20c40fb33b18",
                                                "sense_id": "1eeca9a4-7923-3cec-91fa-ef634e197d2c",
                                                "text": "A pious cause."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6d5adde3-9b63-3754-a5cb-1630ae54d47a",
                                        "entry_id": "e0aed5d2-b1f3-3f56-86e1-8a1b50203d86",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Insisting on or making a show of one's own virtue, especially in comparison to others; sanctimonious, condescending, judgmental."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4007aa53-7253-458f-a4fe-73b0a0a1bac6",
                        "source_entry_id": "9983c370-1fa5-3d39-92ef-ee02f70759f0",
                        "source_sense_id": "a00001aa-dc9b-3be8-9af6-7eaf7a1ee3eb",
                        "target_lang_word": "God-fearing",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "God-fearing",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ca92b21a-b245-3049-854a-190b51da78a9",
                                        "entry_id": "8387a5cd-c7a5-39a9-9f06-1d4d39b660ad",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Following the precepts of a religious practice; respecting and revering God and his authority."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "07b618d3-0f77-4dd9-89b9-468f2d4cf666",
                                                "sense_id": "ca92b21a-b245-3049-854a-190b51da78a9",
                                                "text": "Margie married Bill, a good, God-fearing Christian."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c5a43fa-d5f9-4a40-84cb-75fac056af1c",
                                                "sense_id": "ca92b21a-b245-3049-854a-190b51da78a9",
                                                "text": "The skipper Mr. Cooke had hired at Far Harbor was a God-fearing man with a luke warm interest in his new billet and employer, and had only been prevailed upon to take charge of the yacht after the offer of an emolument equal to half a year's sea pay of an ensign in the navy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f7945cf2-cc30-4b20-a43e-823b9b5dcabd",
                        "source_entry_id": "9983c370-1fa5-3d39-92ef-ee02f70759f0",
                        "source_sense_id": "a00001aa-dc9b-3be8-9af6-7eaf7a1ee3eb",
                        "target_lang_word": "godly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "godly",
